{"id": "route-rag-017", "question": "What services are summarized in the insurance services brochure?", "subcategory": "services_brochure", "expected_route": "retrieval_only", "actual_route": "retrieval_only", "status_code": 200, "latency_ms": 6893.8154, "evaluable": true, "route_correct": true, "operational_success": true, "answer": "The services summarized in the insurance services brochure include:\n\n- **24/7 Assistance**: Emergency assistance available around the clock, 365 days a year.\n- **48-Hour Claims Payment**: Helvetia guarantees claims payment within 48 hours following a successful claims review.\n- **Waiver of Premiums**: In the event of earning disability, premiums are waived until the end of the contract while maintaining insurance cover.\n- **Locksmith Service**: Organization of a tradesman to provide access if entry to residential premises is not possible due to a sudden unforeseen event.\n- **Card Blocking Service**: Blocking of lost credit and debit cards as well as SIM cards upon request.\n- **Home Assistance**: Includes tradesman service, organization of construction management, removal of wasps', hornets', and bees' nests, immediate measures for technical defects, and organization of a security service.\n- **Psychological Follow-Up Support**: Coverage for psychological support costs provided by qualified professionals after an insured event.\n- **Waiver of Gross Negligence**: Waiver of the right to reduce benefits in the event of grossly negligent conduct.\n- **Legal Advice**: Legal advice for all legal disputes provided by the independent legal service of Coop Rechtsschutz.\n\nSource: [brochure-services.pdf, page 2-3]\n\nDocument sources: [brochure-services.pdf, page 2] [brochure-services.pdf, page 3]", "answer_present": true, "crm_fact_recall": null, "crm_reference_resolved": true, "crm_facts": [], "crm_checks": [], "requirement_recall": 1.0, "requirements": [{"id": "services_247", "description": "The services brochure promises round-the-clo